<title>FINLAND: Konecranes 4-mth profit rises 2.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Konecranes 4-mth profit rises 2.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after financial items		  37.1 vs 36.2</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   1.67 vs 1.69</p>
<p> Net sales					  835.5 vs 746.1</p>
<p> Operating profit				  37.3 vs 36.1</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of nine analysts' forecasts for Finnish industrial cranes maker KCI Konecranes' four-month profit after financial items had been 42 million markka in a 30-51 markka range.  </p>
<p> Depreciation					19.6 vs 17.8</p>
<p> Net financial items		     charge 0.2 vs 0.1 gain</p>
<p> Profit before taxes			     37.1 vs 36.2</p>
<p> Taxes						 12.1 vs 10.9</p>
<p> Net profit					  25.0 vs 25.3</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    38.1 vs 37.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish industrial cranes manufacturer is KCI Konecranes International Oy.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
